      "weight": 0.8,
      "explanation": "Triggers lead Sarah to negative appraisals about her own safety and choices, as her worldview becomes one of danger.",
      "quote": "...leading her to feel that the world is inherently unsafe and that something about her drew the violence upon her."
    },
    "Negative_Appraisals__Maladaptive_Strategies": {
      "weight": 0.9,
      "explanation": "Sarah’s negative appraisals of her experiences drive her to engage in maladaptive coping strategies.",
      "quote": "She frequently ruminates about how the assault could have been prevented, leading her to scrutinize her choices and interactions with others."
    },
    "Negative_Appraisals__Threat": {
      "weight": 1.0,
